OecKfNLg38qn_A0MeQhPGJsvDeZhWRLL2gWVDM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwySD4Je3cVXWCI-oZdaWlF8e2foGOwW69R0u4QCMN9ww&oe=69C93871"}, "display_name": "Astro Penguin", "keywords": ["platformer", "adventure", "penguin", "astro"], "long_description": "MARS IS MELTING! \nIts icy poles dissolve into vast oceans, and\neerie green light floods the skies.\n\nBraving the unknown, penguin astronauts\nCAPTAIN PEBBLESWORTH and MAJOR BEEKMAN\nembark on a perilous mission to uncover the truth\u2026\n\nAstro Penguin is a VR platformer. Penguin astronauts have a range of locomotion abilities. They can slide, swim, glide, flap, carve, surf, rocket, grind, (stay tuned for more!). Explore Mars with realistic-feeling movement: feel the wind on your wings.", "short_description": "MARS IS MELTING! \nIts icy poles dissolve into vast oceans, and\neerie green light floods the skies.\n\nBraving the unknown, penguin astronauts\nCAPTAIN PEBBLESWORTH and MAJOR BEEKMAN\nembark on a perilous mission to uncover the truth\u2026\n\nAstro Penguin is a VR platformer. Penguin astronauts have a range of locomotion abilities. They can slide, swim, glide, flap, carve, surf, rocket, grind, (stay tuned for more!). Explore Mars with realistic-feeling movement: feel the wind on your wings."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.interlacevr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Interlace VR LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.interlacevr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommende